    "detailed_description": "Explore the twisting passages and alleys of the Halls, a liminal manifestation of the subconscious of many.   <br><br>After clicking a shady looking <strong>hyperlink </strong>and filling out a <strong>survey</strong>, you find yourself in a non-sensical place where gravity implies no <strong>&quot;up&quot; or &quot;down.&quot; </strong>The unfortunate residents encourage you to find your way out by facing your regrets and getting stronger.<br><br>Gain abilities, jam with foes and conquer the Halls!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/0c92ad2ad976fcdd619ff1f83ea82d0b.poster.avif?t=1750898877\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/0c92ad2ad976fcdd619ff1f83ea82d0b.webm?t=1750898877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/0c92ad2ad976fcdd619ff1f83ea82d0b.mp4?t=1750898877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/169881bd9030f426db9350802e4250c3.avif?t=1750898877\" width=616 height=161 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Walk on walls, use your gravity beam and other abilities you unlock to traverse the Halls how you please.</li><li>Solve <strong>puzzles!</strong> Test your wit with perplexing and disorienting challenges.</li><li>Explore a cute <strong>low-poly</strong> environment with retro-inspired <strong>pixel graphics.</strong></li><li>Make <strong>friends </strong>with the cast of characters in the same situation as you! Help them out with tasks, and they might just <strong>reward </strong>you with items and lore.</li><li><strong>Fight </strong>a plethora of enemies to the beat of unique <strong>soundtracks</strong>!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/205c98974457c98e0371f47203cab52e.poster.avif?t=1750898877\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/205c98974457c98e0371f47203cab52e.webm?t=1750898877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/205c98974457c98e0371f47203cab52e.mp4?t=1750898877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/0d5b00cdfbd20a5add00049c96955f3b.avif?t=1750898877\" width=616 height=161 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Time </strong>your parries, dodges and jumps to the <strong>beat </strong>of the song!</li><li>An expansive list of scores dictate tempo and feel of the combat!</li><li>Almost every sound effect, from abilities, to dialogue, to combat sounds are in tune with the melody!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Explore the twisting passages and alleys of the Halls, a liminal manifestation of the subconscious of many.   <br><br>After clicking a shady looking <strong>hyperlink </strong>and filling out a <strong>survey</strong>, you find yourself in a non-sensical place where gravity implies no <strong>&quot;up&quot; or &quot;down.&quot; </strong>The unfortunate residents encourage you to find your way out by facing your regrets and getting stronger.<br><br>Gain abilities, jam with foes and conquer the Halls!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/0c92ad2ad976fcdd619ff1f83ea82d0b.poster.avif?t=1750898877\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/0c92ad2ad976fcdd619ff1f83ea82d0b.webm?t=1750898877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/0c92ad2ad976fcdd619ff1f83ea82d0b.mp4?t=1750898877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/169881bd9030f426db9350802e4250c3.avif?t=1750898877\" width=616 height=161 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Walk on walls, use your gravity beam and other abilities you unlock to traverse the Halls how you please.</li><li>Solve <strong>puzzles!</strong> Test your wit with perplexing and disorienting challenges.</li><li>Explore a cute <strong>low-poly</strong> environment with retro-inspired <strong>pixel graphics.</strong></li><li>Make <strong>friends </strong>with the cast of characters in the same situation as you! Help them out with tasks, and they might just <strong>reward </strong>you with items and lore.</li><li><strong>Fight </strong>a plethora of enemies to the beat of unique <strong>soundtracks</strong>!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/205c98974457c98e0371f47203cab52e.poster.avif?t=1750898877\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/205c98974457c98e0371f47203cab52e.webm?t=1750898877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/205c98974457c98e0371f47203cab52e.mp4?t=1750898877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986450/extras/0d5b00cdfbd20a5add00049c96955f3b.avif?t=1750898877\" width=616 height=161 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Time </strong>your parries, dodges and jumps to the <strong>beat </strong>of the song!</li><li>An expansive list of scores dictate tempo and feel of the combat!</li><li>Almost every sound effect, from abilities, to dialogue, to combat sounds are in tune with the melody!</li></ul>",
